{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411240","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341124001:1":{"text":"화이트마운틴은 정말 춥네요! 바람이 칼날같아서 얼굴이 차갑고 아파요.","source_cn":"白山好冷啊！风就像刀子一样，吹得我的脸又冷又痛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3EA159C2465691B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341124002:1":{"text":"크림도 소용이 없네요... 분명히 발랐는데요.","source_cn":"面霜也不管用了……我明明涂了的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD5A85938B710F74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341124003:1":{"text":"봐! 내 귀도 얼어서 빨개졌어!","source_cn":"你看，我的耳朵还是被冻红了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8DEC729361323AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341124004:1":{"text":"하지만 해미... 네 귀는 원래 분홍색인데?","source_cn":"可是，漫漫……你的耳朵本来就是粉红色的呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C58E50AECE3A7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}